:bg-surface-container-high hover:text-on-surface transition-all\" data-path=\"ho-so-ca-nhan\" href=\"#\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-md\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003ebadge\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg\"\u003eHồ sơ cá nhân\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:text-on-surface transition-all\" data-path=\"doi-mat-khau\" href=\"#\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-md\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003elock_reset\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg\"\u003eĐổi mật khẩu\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:text-on-surface transition-all\" data-path=\"don-hang-cua-toi\" href=\"#\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-md\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003elocal_shipping\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg\"\u003eĐơn hàng của tôi\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"px-space-sm py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\"\u003e4\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/nav\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"pt-space-md\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"flex items-center gap-space-md px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl text-secondary hover:bg-error-container hover:text-on-error-container transition-all\" data-path=\"dang-xuat\" href=\"#\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003elogout\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg\"\u003eĐăng xuất\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/aside\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"pl-72\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"pt-20 px-8 py-space-md bg-surface\"\u003e\u003cnav class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-on-surface transition-colors\" data-path=\"trang-chu\" href=\"#\"\u003eTrang chủ\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\"\u003echevron_right\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"text-on-surface font-medium\"\u003eTài khoản của tôi\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/nav\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cmain class=\"relative w-full px-8 pb-space-xl bg-surface min-h-[calc(100vh-20rem)]\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col w-full\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Top Section Title --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs mb-space-lg\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"px-space-sm py-0.5 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold\"\u003eTài khoản &amp; Bảo mật\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\"\u003eLần đổi gần nhất: 42 ngày trước\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch1 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight\"\u003eĐổi mật khẩu\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl leading-relaxed\"\u003e\n      Để bảo mật tài khoản, vui lòng không chia sẻ mật khẩu của bạn cho người khác và định kỳ cập nhật mật khẩu 90 ngày/lần.\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Main Grid Layout --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-start\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Left / Center Column: Security Advisory + Form (Col 8) --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"xl:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-space-lg\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Security Advisory Banner --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low p-space-md shadow-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"absolute -right-6 -bottom-6 w-28 h-28 bg-primary/10 rounded-full blur-xl pointer-events-none\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-start gap-space-md relative z-10\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]\"\u003eshield_person\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface\"\u003eGợi ý bảo mật tài khoản FANFUN\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\"\u003e\n              Sử dụng mật khẩu có ít nhất 8 ký tự, bao gồm cả chữ hoa, chữ thường, số và ký tự đặc biệt để bảo vệ tối đa dữ liệu thiết bị thông minh, lịch sử đơn hàng và chứng nhận bảo hành điện tử 36 tháng của bạn.\n            \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Password Change Card Form --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg md:p-space-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-lg\"\u003e\n\u003cform class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-lg\" id=\"change-password-form\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); handlePasswordSubmit();\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Current Password Field --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003clabel class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface flex items-center gap-1\" for=\"current-password\"\u003e\n                Mật khẩu hiện tại \u003cspan class=\"text-primary\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/label\u003e\n\u003ca class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary hover:text-primary-container font-semibold transition-colors\" href=\"#\"\u003e\n                Quên mật khẩu?\n              \u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative flex items-center\"\u003e\n\u003cinput class=\"w-full h-12 px-space-md pr-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md placeholder:text-outline outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:shadow-[0_0_0_2px_#9c3f11] transition-all\" id=\"current-password\" placeholder=\"Nhập mật khẩu hiện tại\" required=\"\" type=\"password\" value=\"FanfunSecure2023!\"/\u003e\n\u003cbutton aria-label=\"Hiển thị hoặc ẩn mật khẩu\" class=\"absolute right-3 p-1.5 rounded-full text-outline hover:text-on-surface transition-colors flex items-center justify-center\" onclick=\"togglePasswordVisibility('current-password', this)\" type=\"button\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003evisibility\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- New Password Field --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs\"\u003e\n\u003clabel class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface flex items-center gap-1\" for=\"new-password\"\u003e\n              Mật khẩu mới \u003cspan class=\"text-primary\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/label\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative flex items-center\"\u003e\n\u003cinput class=\"w-full h-12 px-space-md pr-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md placeholder:text-outline outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:shadow-[0_0_0_2px_#9c3f11] transition-all\" id=\"new-password\" oninput=\"evaluatePasswordStrength(this.value)\" placeholder=\"Tạo mật khẩu mới an toàn\" required=\"\" type=\"password\" value=\"LivingSmart#2024\"/\u003e\n\u003cbutton aria-label=\"Hiển thị hoặc ẩn mật khẩu\" class=\"absolute right-3 p-1.5 rounded-full text-outline hover:text-on-surface transition-colors flex items-center justify-center\" onclick=\"togglePasswordVisibility('new-password', this)\" type=\"button\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003evisibility\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Password Strength Meter Bar --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 mt-space-xs\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant font-medium\"\u003eĐộ mạnh mật khẩu\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-primary\" id=\"strength-label\"\u003eMạnh\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 w-full h-1.5\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-primary transition-all duration-300\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-primary transition-all duration-300\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-primary transition-all duration-300\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-primary/80 transition-all duration-300\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Password Requirements Checklist --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-space-md rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col gap-space-xs\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold mb-1\"\u003eQuy chuẩn mật khẩu FANFUN:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-y-2 gap-x-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs text-on-surface\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;\"\u003echeck_circle\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm font-medium\"\u003eÍt nhất 8 ký tự\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs text-on-surface\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;\"\u003echeck_circle\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm font-medium\"\u003eChữ 