\"resetFormFields()\" type=\"button\"\u003e\n                Hủy\n              \u003c/button\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"px-space-xl py-3 rounded-xl bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold shadow-md hover:bg-primary-container active:scale-[0.99] transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-space-xs\" id=\"btn-submit\" type=\"submit\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003elock_reset\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eĐổi mật khẩu\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/form\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Right Sidebar Column: Active Sessions & Eco-System Guarantee (Col 4) --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"xl:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-space-lg\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Device & Session Info Card --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]\"\u003edevices\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface\"\u003ePhiên đăng nhập &amp; Thiết bị\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"px-space-sm py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\"\u003eHiện tại\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-start gap-space-md p-space-md rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-on-surface flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]\"\u003elaptop_mac\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface truncate\"\u003eChrome trên macOS\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1 mt-0.5\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary inline-block\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n              Hà Nội, Việt Nam • 118.70.198.xxx\n            \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mt-1\"\u003eĐang hoạt động trên trình duyệt này\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-start gap-space-md p-space-md rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low opacity-75\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-on-surface flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]\"\u003esmartphone\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface truncate\"\u003eFANFUN App (iPhone 15)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1 mt-0.5\"\u003e\n              TP. Hồ Chí Minh • 3 giờ trước\n            \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mt-1\"\u003eỨng dụng Smart Living\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline leading-relaxed pt-1\"\u003e\n          Sau khi đổi mật khẩu mới, bạn sẽ được tự động giữ đăng nhập trên thiết bị hiện tại và có thể yêu cầu đăng xuất từ xa ở các phiên khác.\n        \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Quick Security Metric Card --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs text-primary\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003everified_user\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface\"\u003eMức độ an toàn tài khoản\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-md\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative w-16 h-16 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Inline SVG Gauge (92%) --\u003e\n\u003csvg class=\"w-16 h-16 transform -rotate-90\" viewbox=\"0 0 36 36\"\u003e\n\u003cpath class=\"text-surface-variant\" d=\"M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\n\u003cpath class=\"text-primary\" d=\"M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-dasharray=\"92, 100\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\n\u003c/svg\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"absolute font-headline-sm text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface\"\u003e92%\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface\"\u003eRất an toàn\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\"\u003eTài khoản được bảo vệ bởi chứng thực mã hóa dữ liệu quạt trần 3-in-1.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Smart Living Support Widget --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-md shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed text-primary flex items-center justify-center\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\"\u003esupport_agent\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\"\u003eCần hỗ trợ gấp?\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface\"\u003e1900 6868 (24/7)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"px-space-sm py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm\"\u003eMiễn cước\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cscript\u003e\n    function togglePasswordVisibility(fieldId, btnElement) {\n      const input = document.getElementById(fieldId);\n      const icon = btnElement.querySelector('.material-symbols-outlined');\n      if (input.type === 'password') {\n        input.type = 'text';\n        icon.textContent = 'visibility_off';\n      } else {\n        input.type = 'password';\n        icon.textContent = 'visibility';\n      }\n    }\n\n    function evaluatePasswordStrength(val) {\n      const label = document.getElementById('strength-label');\n      if (val.length === 0) {\n        label.textContent = 'Chưa nhập';\n        label.className = 'font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-outline';\n        return;\n      }\n      if (val.length \u003c 8) {\n        label.textContent = 'Yếu';\n        label.className = 'font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-error';\n      } else if (val.length \u003c 12) {\n        label.textContent = 'Trung bình';\n        label.className = 'font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-tertiary';\n      } else {\n        label.textContent = 'Mạnh';\n        label.className = 'font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-primary';\n      }\n      verifyMatch();\n    }\n\n    function verifyMatch() {\n      const p1 = document.getElementById('new-password').value;\n      const p2 = document.getElementById('confirm-password').value;\n      const matchElem = document.getElementById('match-status');\n      \n      if (!p2) {\n        matchElem.classList.add('hidden');\n        return;\n      }\n      matchElem.classList.remove('hidden');\n      if (p1 === p2) {\n        matchElem.className = 'flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-0.5 text-primary';\n        matchElem.innerHTML = '\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\"\u003everified\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\"\u003eMật khẩu trùng khớp\u003c/span\u003e';\n      } else {\n        matchElem.className = 'flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-0.5 text-error';\n        matchElem.innerHTML = '\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\"\u003eerror\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\"\u003eMật khẩu xác nhận chưa khớp\u003c/span\u003e';\n      }\n    }\n\n    function handlePasswordSubmit() {\n      const notif = document.getElementById('success-notification');\n      const btn = document.getElementById('btn-submit');\n      \n      btn.innerHTML = '\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] animate-spin\"\u003erefresh\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eĐang xử lý...\u003c/span\u003e';\n      btn.disabled = true;\n\n      setTimeout(() =\u003e {\n        btn.disabled = false;\n        btn.innerHTML = '\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\"\u003elock_reset\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eĐổi mật khẩu\u003c/span\u003e';\n        notif.classList.remove('hidden');\n        notif.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });\n      }, 700);\n    }\n\n    function resetFormFields() {\n      document.getElementById('change-password-form').reset();\n      document.getElementById('success-notification').classList.add('hidden');\n      document.getElementById('match-status').classList.add('hidden');\n      const label = document.getElementById('strength-label');\n      label.textContent = 'Chưa nhập';\n      label.className = 'font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-outline';\n    }\n  \u003c/script\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/main\u003e\u003cfooter class=\"w-full bg-surface-container-low py-space-xl\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"w-full px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-sm\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-primary\"\u003eFANFUN\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider pl-1\"\u003eSmart Living\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\"\u003eThoải mái quanh năm, thông minh mỗi ngày. Tiên phong giải pháp làm mát, thanh lọc không khí và chiếu sáng thông minh cho tổ ấm Việt Nam.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mt-space-sm\"\u003e© 2024 FANFUN Việt Nam. All rights reserved.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-sm\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface\"\u003eSản phẩm\u003c/span\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors\" data-path=\"san-pham-he-sinh-thai\" href=\"#\"\u003eQuạt Trần Thông Minh 3-in-1\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors\" data-path=\"san-pham-he-sinh-thai\" href=\"#\"\u003eQuạt Đứng Tuần Hoàn Khí\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors\" data-path=\"san-pham-he-sinh-thai\" href=\"#\"\u003eLõi Lọc HEPA H13 Khử Khuẩn\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors\" data-path=\"san-pham-he-sinh-thai\" href=\"#\"\u003ePhụ Kiện &amp; Cảm Biến Môi Trường\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-sm\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface\"\u003eHỗ trợ khách hàng\u003c/span\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"font-body-s